   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Various products on sale at Matsumoto Kiyoshi drugstore in Yurakucho on October 14, 2015, Tokyo, Japan. Matsumoto Kiyoshi is Japan's biggest pharmacy chain selling low price cosmetics and medicine. It was founded in 1932 and claims to serve over 16% of the Japanese population. (Photo by Rodrigo Reyes Marin/AFLO)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
