   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">People shop at Daiso store in Harajuku on October 14, 2015, Tokyo, Japan. Daiso is one of the biggest 100 Yen shop chains in Japan with a range of more than 100,000 items ranging from garden equipment to phone chargers for 100 yen (approx. USD 1.00). (Photo by Rodrigo Reyes Marin/AFLO)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
